# This file keeps the data/ folder in the repo so it's ready to use.
#
# Drop your WiGLE exports here and just run the tool:
#   - a "Database Backup" .sqlite  (best - coverage + track + run views; extensionless is fine)
#   - or KML / CSV exports
#
# Everything in this folder carries real GPS, so it's ALL ignored (extensionless
# backups included) - only this .gitignore is tracked. Never commit the exports.
*
!.gitignore
